{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultists have attacked your village and destroyed your home. Set out on a quest for vengeance and use your mastery of dice, probabilities, and magic to settle the score or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome the odds?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Dice - Roll the dice you've collected in sequential order to complete quests and obtain rewards. Fail and receive nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes - Choose between Story Mode and Endless Mode. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and Try Again - Live, die, and repeat. No two runs are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship - Collect a variety of companions to aid you in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice - Boost your power with a variety of dice and special dice effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent Upgrades - No luck this time? Purchase persistent upgrades to boost your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up - Earn experience to unlock attributes and acquire items and equipment to build your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses - Overcome a range of powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093860?t=1762263219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093860?t=1762263219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/7403781f164637bdbb2e39f1bf424954cdb5d0fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762263219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093860/7403781f164637bdbb2e39f1bf424954cdb5d0fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762263219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id"